Subject: [PATCH 7/9] inScope's comment names the game's own agency without its
 name, which the engine's code never carries

The comment written for the review named Halberd Talent, and tests/pro-core.test.ts holds the engine's systems to naming
no agent or agency, so that a second one stays an entry of data. It says "the game's own agency's" instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HBdcuKzBBMbipfFQSByALG
